    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Iveria, where two powerful factions \u2014 the noble, fortress-strong Defugel and the vast, country-like Craxion \u2014 wage war for control of the continent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4Story is a classic MMORPG with an iconic <strong>realm-vs-realm (RvR)</strong> system, offering large-scale battles, thrilling PvP, and a dynamic world shaped by conflict. Whether you choose to defend the honor of Defugel or fight for the freedom of Craxion, the battlefield is yours to conquer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two-Faction War System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>Defugel</strong> or <strong>Craxion</strong> and take part in massive realm battles, battlegrounds, and sieges that decide the fate of Iveria.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Sieges &amp; Territory Wars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture fortresses, defend outposts, and shape the political map through <strong>strategic PvP warfare</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic PvP and PvE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>dungeons, raids, and world bosses</strong>, or challenge rival players in open-world PvP and structured battlegrounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guilds and Alliances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a guild or join forces with other players to dominate <strong>territory wars and large-scale PvP</strong> events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mounts, Gear, and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons, unlock powerful mounts, and tailor your character to your preferred combat style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic MMORPG Feel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, deep to master \u2014 <strong>4Story combines nostalgic MMORPG charm with community-driven events and war-focused gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you stand with Defugel or Craxion?</strong><br>Choose your side and write your legend on the battlefield.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Iveria, where two powerful factions \u2014 the noble, fortress-strong Defugel and the vast, country-like Craxion \u2014 wage war for control of the continent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4Story is a classic MMORPG with an iconic <strong>realm-vs-realm (RvR)</strong> system, offering large-scale battles, thrilling PvP, and a dynamic world shaped by conflict. Whether you choose to defend the honor of Defugel or fight for the freedom of Craxion, the battlefield is yours to conquer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two-Faction War System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>Defugel</strong> or <strong>Craxion</strong> and take part in massive realm battles, battlegrounds, and sieges that decide the fate of Iveria.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Sieges &amp; Territory Wars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture fortresses, defend outposts, and shape the political map through <strong>strategic PvP warfare</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic PvP and PvE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>dungeons, raids, and world bosses</strong>, or challenge rival players in open-world PvP and structured battlegrounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guilds and Alliances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a guild or join forces with other players to dominate <strong>territory wars and large-scale PvP</strong> events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mounts, Gear, and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons, unlock powerful mounts, and tailor your character to your preferred combat style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic MMORPG Feel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, deep to master \u2014 <strong>4Story combines nostalgic MMORPG charm with community-driven events and war-focused gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you stand with Defugel or Craxion?</strong><br>Choose your side and write your legend on the battlefield.</p>",
    "short_description": "Between Berkilious, the God of Destruction, and Lea, the Goddess of creation, long-lasting antagonism has repeated numerous creations and destructions. In the name of the Goddess Lea, exists the world of Iveria. In this world of chaos, will there be a hero to end this war once and for all?",
